    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Une jeune femme, 20/25 ans, regard arrogant ainsi appara\u00eet-elle sur une photo dans le film. Nous savons qu'elle porte le m\u00eame pr\u00e9nom que Louise Michel. Mais qui est-elle ? Qu'est-ce qui la relie \u00e0 Madeleine ? Quel lien ? Amical ? Familial ? Est-elle morte ? Ou est-elle encore en vie ? Madeleine lui parle, l'attend, la voit, la cherche et l'esp\u00e8re\u2026 Et si ce n'\u00e9tait que l'illusion d'un esprit qui lentement, inexorablement vacille et que Madeleine cache ?",
        "english": "A young woman, 20/25 years old, looks arrogant as she appears on a photo in the film. We know that she has the same name as Louise Michel. But who is she ? What connects her to Madeleine ? What link ? Friendly ? Family ? Is she dead ? Or is she still alive? Madeleine is talking to her, waiting for her, seeing her, looking for her and hoping for her - What if it was only the illusion of a spirit that slowly, inexorably wavers and Madeleine hides ?"
